    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Planet: Voidregula 6.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hazard class: Not assigned</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scan result: Suitable for colonization.\u00a0Terraform with caution!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: Prepared, the first stage of settlement is underway.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Problem: Communication with the planet is completely interrupted. We are sending an expedition.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.poster.avif?t=1754897167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.webm?t=1754897167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.mp4?t=1754897167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of roguelike shooter and survival on an unknown planet, featuring persistent progress and a cozy hub. Attempt to unravel the mysteries of what has happened by exploring stations, dungeons, canyons, swamps, and permafrost, while battling alien creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrenaline shooter.</strong> Each enemy is a mortal danger. Caution, reaction and aim are as important as a saved ammo and an extra explosion that raises the alarm in the den of creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At night it's more dangerous.</strong> Survival with elements of horror. Stock up on oxygen, flashlight batteries and ammo in advance to have a chance of surviving another night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wide range of weapons and equipment.</strong> Pistols, assault rifles, shotguns, machine guns, grenade launchers, katanas, night vision, energy shields, sound absorption, weapon upgrades and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos and progression</strong>. Recipes for unique weapons. Enhancements that transform your character. Shops and secret rooms throughout the levels. Weapon upgrades in the hub.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or co-op up to 4 players.</strong> Play shoulder to shoulder, protect your teammates' rear and share resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/7cd13f3f2bb4223befedee11c246c964.avif?t=1754897167\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Planet: Voidregula 6.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hazard class: Not assigned</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scan result: Suitable for colonization.\u00a0Terraform with caution!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: Prepared, the first stage of settlement is underway.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Problem: Communication with the planet is completely interrupted. We are sending an expedition.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.poster.avif?t=1754897167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.webm?t=1754897167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.mp4?t=1754897167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of roguelike shooter and survival on an unknown planet, featuring persistent progress and a cozy hub. Attempt to unravel the mysteries of what has happened by exploring stations, dungeons, canyons, swamps, and permafrost, while battling alien creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrenaline shooter.</strong> Each enemy is a mortal danger. Caution, reaction and aim are as important as a saved ammo and an extra explosion that raises the alarm in the den of creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At night it's more dangerous.</strong> Survival with elements of horror. Stock up on oxygen, flashlight batteries and ammo in advance to have a chance of surviving another night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wide range of weapons and equipment.</strong> Pistols, assault rifles, shotguns, machine guns, grenade launchers, katanas, night vision, energy shields, sound absorption, weapon upgrades and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos and progression</strong>. Recipes for unique weapons. Enhancements that transform your character. Shops and secret rooms throughout the levels. Weapon upgrades in the hub.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or co-op up to 4 players.</strong> Play shoulder to shoulder, protect your teammates' rear and share resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/7cd13f3f2bb4223befedee11c246c964.avif?t=1754897167\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udd2b\ud83d\udc7d Adrenaline shooter-roguelike with a survival and suspense atmosphere. Caution and accuracy are as important as conserved ammo and an extra explosion that raises the alarm in the lair. Stock up on oxygen, batteries, and ammo to survive another terrifying night.",
